Upstream patch: bulk Present scratch buffers ([G4-PRESENT], ported by G5).
Replaces element-wise 1.3 MB host-frame fill and 4 MB VRAM snapshot
construction with bulk memmove/memcpy of identical bytes.
Self-contained; apply with `patch -p1` from the repo root against
the pinned upstream revision.
